upstream projects.

The upstream source baseline is preserved in this repository's git
history as commit 82c2eb0e ("chore: import OpenMinis upstream
baseline"). Historical releases prior to the open-source transition are
archived at https://github.com/ccbili30-collab/novex-android
(archived, read-only).

Third-party components and their licenses are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

